{
  "uid": "chatbot-traces",
  "title": "Chatbot / Traces",
  "tags": [
    "chatbot"
  ],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": {
    "from": "now-1h",
    "to": "now"
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "title": "Spans accepted",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Spans the collector took from the application, per second.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "chatbot-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (receiver) (rate(otelcol_receiver_accepted_spans{job=\"otel-collector\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "title": "Spans refused or failed",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Telemetry dropped on the way in. Anything above zero means the tree in Langfuse is incomplete.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 0,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "chatbot-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (receiver) (rate(otelcol_receiver_refused_spans{job=\"otel-collector\"}[5m])) + sum by (receiver) (rate(otelcol_receiver_failed_spans{job=\"otel-collector\"}[5m]))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "ops",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "title": "Export queue",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Queued batches against the configured capacity. A queue that stays full is an export that is not keeping up.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "chatbot-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "otelcol_exporter_queue_size{job=\"otel-collector\"} / clamp_min(otelcol_exporter_queue_capacity{job=\"otel-collector\"}, 1)",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "title": "Batches in flight",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Export requests the collector is waiting on.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 8,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "chatbot-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (exporter) (otelcol_exporter_in_flight_requests{job=\"otel-collector\"})",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "title": "Collector memory",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Resident memory of the collector process against its container limit.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "chatbot-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "otelcol_process_memory_rss{job=\"otel-collector\"}",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "bytes",
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "title": "Batch size",
      "type": "timeseries",
      "description": "Spans per batch sent onward; the shape of what the pipeline actually ships.",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 12,
        "y": 16,
        "w": 12,
        "h": 8
      },
      "datasource": {
        "type": "prometheus",
        "uid": "chatbot-prometheus"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(otelcol_processor_batch_batch_send_size_bucket{job=\"otel-collector\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "__auto",
          "range": true
        }
      ],
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "min": 0
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": {
          "displayMode": "list",
          "placement": "bottom"
        },
        "tooltip": {
          "mode": "multi"
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "title": "About this dashboard",
      "type": "text",
      "gridPos": {
        "x": 0,
        "y": 24,
        "w": 24,
        "h": 5
      },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "The export pipeline of the `llm` Compose profile (docs/observability-plan.md \u00a78.3). It is empty whenever that profile is not running, which is a supported state: metrics, dashboards and the diagnostics API do not depend on it.\n\nThese are the collector's own counters, so they say what the collector accepted, queued and shipped \u2014 not what Langfuse stored. Spans still inside the application's batch processor are not here either; that buffer is bounded and flushed once on shutdown.\n\nThe traces themselves are read in Langfuse on http://127.0.0.1:3000. Grafana stores no traces and has no trace datasource here: a jump from a histogram to a trace needs Tempo or a configured Langfuse link, which is O07."
      }
    }
  ]
}
